## PokemonApi

### 
## 
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/ability/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### 
## 
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/ability/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

